WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:04.633
Meet Skrivist, a quieter home for your EPUBs.

00:00:04.933 --> 00:00:12.633
Bring your EPUBs into one calm library, synced in the cloud and ready when you are.

00:00:12.933 --> 00:00:20.633
Tune the page until it feels right, then let the interface get out of the way.

00:00:20.933 --> 00:00:28.633
Choose Light, Sepia, E-paper, or Dark, so the page matches the hour.

00:00:28.933 --> 00:00:36.633
When your eyes need a rest, switch to read aloud and keep the story moving.

00:00:36.933 --> 00:00:44.033
Add rain, fire, or café sounds. Install it once, and keep reading offline.

00:00:44.333 --> 00:00:51.033
Start on your laptop. Continue on your phone. Your shelf and your place stay in sync.

00:00:51.333 --> 00:00:57.200
Already use Calibre? Bring that shelf into Skrivist without rebuilding it by hand.

00:00:57.500 --> 00:01:04.800
Skrivist. A quiet reader for books you own. Read free, or sync with Skrivist Cloud.
